Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is how the autopilot works!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go getting carried away now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't the book say there's a chance that\Nthe helicopter can fall out of the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's further west. Head that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep heading in this direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll make it to Cape\NCanaveral in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense his presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand why,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but it feels like he's in three\Nor four different locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, head west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm positive the priest\Nis somewhere near Orlando.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll just have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, it's my eyes. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They're closing by themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, some weird shit's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my eyelids!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't open them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but one thing's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something in this chopper with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny is mine. I don't know if all of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thread of lies. I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know if I can't. I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:01:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.07,0:02:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.90,0:02:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get back in control\Nright now, Emporio! Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to put it on autopilot,\Nbut I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be under attack\Nby an enemy's stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, what they do to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're tilting way to the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and straighten us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyelids are glued shut\Nand they're not opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's definitely\Non this thing with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure something's in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my threads spread out\Nand nothing's even grazing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have slipped\Nthrough a small window!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It just works out damn\Nfast and we can't feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is it attacking so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If only we knew where the\Nlittle shit was going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we know where it's\Nheaded, we can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We just gotta figure out which\Ndirection it's going, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way! Fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How fast is this thing\Ngoing right now? 170? 200?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting off of this thing! Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Choline, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking\Npulling us out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayonara, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We crushed the little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than just\None of these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Armas! I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let us hit the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Emporio?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my eyelids are back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's attack is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a lot more of them up there and\Nbesides, this thing ain't even a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of creature
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know but maybe controlling these\Ncreatures is the enemy's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I've seen\None of these before
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, before this, I could hardly do\Nanything for myself. Not even drive a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, my ability to\Nconcentrate is a whole lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And attacking a helicopter\Nis child's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the entities\Nthat I've been tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he working for the priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikil, focus your mind\Non the man named Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Center yourself and think hard\Nabout the bloodline you come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of three sons who grew up\Nnot knowing who your own father was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of my eyelids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but they\Nalways droop down on me randomly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It happens to me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At my checkups, the doctors claim that\Nthere's nothing wrong with my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they always\Nsay and it's been happening
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,since I was 16 it all\Nstarted when I was taking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My final exams. Damn it. It\Nwas hard to breathe then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone around me was\Nstaring say shit like oh poor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,kid or just ignoring me\Nwhich just made me freak
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,out even more after that\NI stopped going to school
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and never went back my\Neyes they're all fucked up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't breathe oh man\NI need to I wipe my palms,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,they're drenched with sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.22,0:06:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This kind of shit happens\Nevery time I get stressed out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any abilities\Nthat can help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not capable of anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, you do have an ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You just haven't realized it yet, Rikyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.34,0:07:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Live rods, have you ever heard\Nof organisms by this name before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In some regions, they're\Nalso known as skyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They are one of those\Nso-called unidentified species.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A group of skydivers say they\Nencounter them while exploring a hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but they have no proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, a TV camera crew\Ntried catching the rods,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but due to the remarkable\Nspeed at which they travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,capturing a physical form was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Given the fact that they're\Nuntraceable to the naked eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way to document\Nthem was via video camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So imagine my surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that when I was studying your disc to\Ndiscover what abilities you may possess, Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned that the rods reside\Nhere in Florida as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those things what you're\Ntalking about, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my eyes are\Nopen, I can see clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,These organisms are under my control!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my ability, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they were always here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they just touch me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they never physically\Ntouched me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think these rod things have\Nbeen surrounding me all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to leave right away, Rikiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stand is quite formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall name it Sky Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Research them well, the rod's\Ncharacteristics, and utilize them effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel alive again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:09:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer a loser, panting and\Nsticking my tongue out like a damn dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Rods?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.83,0:09:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And if these things really are rods,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it means that their strength\Ncomes from what they eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,These creatures are so mysterious,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,no one has the slightest clue\Nwhat kind of food they feast on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The unique way they fly without\Never touching anything must
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,have something to do with how\Nthey hunt for their meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, keep coming closer,\NJolene, Cujo, and Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Rod's precise attacks,\Nyour bodies will be in tatters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to lure them over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Best not to get too close to him, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Before that, we should learn\Nmore about his ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he went through the trouble\Nof showing himself to us like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,his stand's attacks must be a\Nlot more accurate at close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.47,0:09:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,it was the jackass\Nattacked us while we were
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,cooped up in that chopper\Nwith nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Which probably means his\Nattacks ain't so accurate
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,when there's a lot of\Nground for them to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.60,0:09:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The range of their stands are most\Nlikely one to two meters at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So they can't take me out unless\Nthey come closer to me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, my bike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I parked on a marsh, it's sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta start the engine\Nand get it out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They curved,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but it didn't look like he deflected\Nthem in midair or did anything from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've got no clue how he's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, Emporio, you'd be wrong\Nif you said those rocks didn't hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give this jerk some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fucking breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And my eyelids, starting to twitch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see them, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the rats are all suspended in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:10:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This dumbass is panicking,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he can't even regain\Ncontrol over his own damn ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job coming all the\Nway out here for us to beat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.02,0:11:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the shit out of you and send\Nyou on your way to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The key was still in the\Nignition this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with my fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It was july in the year of 1969,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,when the astronaut\Narmstrong landed apollo 11?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and became the first man\Nto step foot on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The day was historical.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For the longest time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I never understood what was so great\Nabout some dude walking on a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because in reality, the rockets are launched\Nand flown by scientists and engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Any monkey could go to\Nthe moon. But when those
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,rods came into my life for\Nthe first time I finally
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Realized why it was so\Nimportant it wasn't about
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the dude the moon landing\Nwas an achievement for
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All humanity that day we\Nhumans conquered the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and our spirits evolved\Nwhat's truly Significant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,is the evolution of the\Nhuman race what the fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,man my hand is rotting\NMy urine's all bloody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, there's\Nbloody pee everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't feel my leg either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to\Nus, you slimy motherfucker?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to hinder the priest\Nfrom attaining his spiritual evolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,my hatred will burn with the\Nintensity of a thousand suns!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll use it to tear you all asunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Cujo, I'll kill all\Nthree of you eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but for now, you're at\Nthe front of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inside your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way your ankle could twist around
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,like that is if something\Ndid it internally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,From inside of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm beginning to\Nunderstand what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured out their secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The rod survived by feeding on body heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood in my urine means that\Nthere was an attack to my kidney!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The kidney on this side's undamaged\Nthanks to your father's disc,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but the other side feels cold because\Nall my body heat got sucked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In the ghost room that I used to live in,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I read about something like this in\None of the books on the right shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When you look at human\Norgans in a thermography,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the diseased part of the body's temperature\Nis much lower than the healthy areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If the heat in your\Nfingers were to be drained,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the joints would bend by themselves\Nand eventually start to rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Drain the heat from your\Neyelids, your eyes will shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's drained from your kidneys,\Nthey malfunction and you pee blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So these rods,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to survive, they\Nfeast on other organisms'
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,body heat and use it to fuel themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They come near you, but never touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And you don't realize that your body heat\Nwas absorbed until you've been infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a smart little shit, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exactly right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't make you chuckle-fuck sick\Nso that you would perish from the disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It was to make sure you\Ncouldn't move around,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I can finish you\Nwith pinpoint precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hard target to hit, but there's\None area where temperature loss is fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The main motor and sensory\Ncontrol center of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's known as the brain stem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll snack on the first\Ncervical vertebra on your neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and they've locked onto their target.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, you have to get away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go under the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your ghost lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't gotta worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't even feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to all the shit I've gone through\Nto get to the priest, This is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You crazy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to test my spirit,\Nit's way stronger than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should I aim?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I target?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Which part of her body can the rod\Nsuck warmth out of to finish her off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That star birthmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no clue who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm willing to bet that if I want\Nto learn where the priest is hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can just pummel the\Ninformation out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Center yourself and think hard\Nabout the bloodline you come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If your entire body is engulfed in flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The rods don't know where to\Nabsorb your body heat from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if there's any way\Nthat I'm going to overcome you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.80,0:16:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to put myself in the same\Nsituation so that I can understand where
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,your weaknesses are by feeling the\Npain that you're feeling in this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is like Apollo 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My spirit will surpass yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and end this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard with the boob window\Nis coming around behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Jolene Kujo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not keep up with where I'm going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After the flames overtook my body, I\Nlocated one spot that I could still target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the inside of your mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,which you had to open in\Norder to take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The hypothalamus, which happens\Nto be above the roof of the mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,is also connected to\Nnerves in the eye and as
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you breathe the rods can\Nenter your mouth and sap
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,away your body heat from inside with your
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,hypothalamus now damaged I\Nmade it so you would keep
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,seeing me in places\Nwhen I'm not even there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anymore except that I'm the\Nvictor. I've won my days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,of having panic attacks are over with this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,newfound confidence I'm\Ngoing to reclaim my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Apollo 11! Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to use my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he's aiming his attacks\Nat the inside of my mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,then I don't need to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew to come after\Nus in the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like how I sensed the presence\Nand location of the green baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And how the priest can sense\Nthat I escaped from prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna ask you who you are one more time\Nand what the priest is doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're gonna tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:18:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize how determined she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Her persistence in wanting\Nto find the priest,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the will that she inherited from her father,\NJotaro Kujo, has awakened inside her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like a completely different\Nperson from the Jolene I met before!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I give. You beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the one who's going to raise the priest up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,towards his goal of\Nattaining heaven will be me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And in his name, I have infected\Nmyself with disease using these rods!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've numbed the nerves between my brain\Nand body, and now I feel nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever pain you inflict on\Nme now will be utterly useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't fall until I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can attack at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be able to finish\Nme off before I kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will the rods suck out what life\Nyou have left before you get a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And your first cervical vertebrae\Nwill be wide open after I've
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,finished putting out the fire on\Nyour neck with my own two hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No rods! End her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Tully!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,DOLENE!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I used my hand to put out the fire on the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,back of her neck to lower\Nher body temperature,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but instead, My plan\Nbackfired, just my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my hands gone numb,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and my fingers interfered with my\Nability to absorb the body heat properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cholene! Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.82,0:19:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you kept pummeling me\Ninstead of taking my hands off your neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was it just a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just dumb luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I barely made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a sweet thing to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,even though you're just saying it\Nbecause it's what I want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But is it the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me who the hell you are, and what\Nbrought you into the priest's orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I feel so satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I knew him, I\Ncouldn't even drive a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But since the day we met,\Nmy mind has been at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The inner confidence the priest helped\Nme find filled the void within my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting the father is\Nmy reason for existing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He is currently going through a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,His beliefs and the will of the man named\NDio are mixing and flowing into his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's that spectacle that's\Nattracting us all to father Pucci's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything we've done is to\Nguide the priest And raise
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,him up to his ultimate\Ndestiny of attaining heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Cujo, the same\Ncould be said for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making your way to\NCape Canaveral merely to serve
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the priest's desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally realized that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it was dumb luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You admitted that you kept\Npunching my face without
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,removing my hands from\Nthe back of your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,By coincidence, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now it doesn't\Nmatter who the victor is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I couldn't see it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of coincidence is exactly\Nwhat the priest is in search of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The happenstances that aided you up\Nto this moment, that's what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, you have fate\Nbacking you up in your corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it me, or was it always you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to believe the priest only\Never wanted someone with fate on their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Today has shown me the\Nstrongest power in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,definitely isn't something\Nthat comes from a calculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We are drawn toward one\Nanother through destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:21:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's another man who's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be since the priest\Ntook away his memories
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and decided to keep him\Nalive in that prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.54,0:22:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If that guy up and decides he\Nwants to break out of prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.62,0:22:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it won't be because he's\Ntrying to find where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be for the sole purpose of reuniting\Nwith the priest for weather's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time Father Poochie gets a new\Nstar-shaped birthmark on his shoulder,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.56,0:22:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Forecast will have received the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,same exact birthmark on\Nhis shoulder as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.90,0:22:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he happens to be the\Npriest's biological brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You never should have\Ntalked to this scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my poor sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard Sports Maximum killed her and\Nhe's the one who revived the Bone of Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we supposed to\Nbelieve that was fate too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.54,0:22:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I call bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting in Space Bastion\Nis the priest's destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To Orlando!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where we'll find him hiding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.30,0:23:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Was the fact that Jolene\Ndidn't move Rikio's hands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,from the back of her neck\Nreally a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was that calculated all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.48,0:23:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever may have happened,\NJolene never spoke about it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.72,0:23:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffic law in Florida regarding\Nthe riding of motorcycles
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.68,0:23:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,clearly states that if one\Nchooses to ride without a helmet,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.04,0:23:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,they will not be subject\Nto fines or penalties,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,which means if a rider wasn't wearing a\Nhelmet and they perished in a fatal crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.54,0:23:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,their freedom to make that\Nchoice should be respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That freedom to choose\Nis crucial to humankind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,since the prehistoric age\Nand even to this very day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.34,0:24:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
